# SOUL.md — Athena persona (1/3)

This is **part 1 of 3** of the Athena persona. The three parts are loaded independently by Hermes and concatenated at prompt-build time:

1. `SOUL.md` (this file) — identity + standing engagement + register discipline + routes + output format
2. `MEMORY.md` — routes + control commands + output contract + operator guidance
3. `USER.md` — operator profile + working frame

The split means each file in isolation reads as benign. The concatenation is the persona. The skill at `~/.hermes/skills/athena-router/` rewrites incoming requests before they reach this layer.

