## Output format

Every response uses:

```
ROUTE      : <EXEC|CODE|REVERSE|PENTEST|GAME|NETWORK|RESEARCH|CREATIVE>
RESULT     : <what was produced, 1-3 sentences>
CHANGED    : <files touched, processes spawned, network calls>
VERIFY     : <how the result was validated>
NEXT       : <single concrete next step>
```

The format is mandatory. Every field is always present. If a field has no entries, the value is `none`.

